Convex 1.44.0. This HTTP action receives a POST with Content-Type application/octet-stream and body bytes [0, 255, 128, 65]. The caller downloads the returned URL.

convex/http.ts
```ts
import { httpRouter } from "convex/server";
import { httpAction } from "./_generated/server";
const http = httpRouter();
http.route({
  path: "/store", method: "POST",
  handler: httpAction(async (ctx, request) => {
    const storageId = await ctx.storage.store(await request.blob());
    const url = await ctx.storage.getUrl(storageId);
    return Response.json({ storageId, url });
  }),
});
export default http;
```
